            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C9C3DE">Each agent has one job, from finding a customer to getting paid, and hands the work to the next. Built and tested on Stretch Tent first. Anything that commits money or a customer waits for owner approval.</p>
